nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(22年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"60.8\" width=\"320\" height=\"7.299999999999997\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,65.7 9.1,71.5 14.2,66.2 19.3,62.3 24.5,69.1 29.6,88.5 34.7,85.6 39.8,91.9 44.9,94.3 50.0,92.4 55.1,94.8 60.3,97.2 65.4,94.3 70.5,94.3 75.6,95.3 80.7,87.0 85.8,90.0 91.0,79.3 96.1,84.1 101.2,81.2 106.3,74.9 111.4,69.6 116.5,69.6 121.6,71.5 126.8,54.5 131.9,42.9 137.0,39.9 142.1,53.1 147.2,56.0 152.3,37.0 157.4,43.8 162.6,34.6 167.7,18.1 172.8,12.8 177.9,36.5 183.0,30.7 188.1,28.3 193.2,36.1 198.4,32.7 203.5,31.7 208.6,38.5 213.7,51.6 218.8,43.8 223.9,56.9 229.0,56.9 234.2,56.0 239.3,56.0 244.4,60.3 249.5,64.2 254.6,75.4 259.7,63.7 264.9,58.4 270.0,49.7 275.1,50.6 280.2,53.5 285.3,47.7 290.4,38.0 295.5,34.6 300.7,34.6 305.8,46.7 310.9,44.8 316.0,49.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 77.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 77.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 77.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 77.7 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 147.2 68.0 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 213.7 63.6 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"49.7\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1